		<div class="container py-5 fade-in">
	<div class="row">
						<div class="max-w-2xl lg:w-10/12 mx-auto wysiwyg ">
						<h2>Application Process</h2>
<h3>Purpose and Scope</h3>
<p>The Application and Recognition Process ensures impartiality and objectivity. Recognition is subject to periodic review. The adoption and application of any of these security features remains at the full discretion of the London Operating Vaults.</p>
		</div>
