<p>Recognition is subject to periodic review. LBMA, nor any of its group companies’ respective directors, officers, employees or agents (collectively the “Disclaiming Parties”) shall be liable in respect of the accuracy or the completeness of the Security Feature List (SF List) or the information related thereto and none of the disclaiming parties shall have any liability for any errors, omissions, delays or interruptions in providing the SF List or associated information. No disclaiming party makes any warranty, express or implied, as to results to be obtained by use of the SF List or associated information. The SF List and associated information is provided “as is” and no disclaiming party makes any express or implied warranties, conditions, guarantees or representations, with respect to the SF List or associated information and the Disclaiming Parties expressly disclaim all warranties, of merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose or use, satisfactory quality or non-infringement with respect to the SF List or any data related thereto. Without limiting any of the foregoing, in no event shall any disclaiming party have any liability for any loss of profit, loss of or anticipated loss of revenue, loss of use, business interruption, loss of use of any equipment, loss of any contract or other business opportunity or goodwill or indirect, punitive, special, incidental or consequential damages, even if advised of the possibility of such loss or whether such loss otherwise would have been foreseen.</p>
<p>No Advice. The SF List and associated information is provided for general information purposes only and provision of the SF List or associated information does not constitute legal, financial, or other professional advice. No Disclaiming Party shall be responsible for any costs or damages resulting from your use or reliance of the SF List of associated information, including but not limited to decisions relating to the sale and purchase of instruments or legal, compliance and/or risk management decisions. You agree that you access the content at your own risk in these respects.</p>
